  "Agriculture is more than growing crops. It's about understanding the soil beneath our feet, the changing weather above us, and the decisions that shape tomorrow.": "କୃଷି କେବଳ ଫସଲ ଚାଷ ନୁହେଁ। ମାଟି, ବଦଳୁଥିବା ପାଣିପାଗ ଓ ଭବିଷ୍ୟତ ଗଢ଼ୁଥିବା ନିଷ୍ପତ୍ତି ବୁଝିବା ମଧ୍ୟ।",
  "ProFarm brings essential farming knowledge and useful digital tools together in one accessible place, helping farmers work toward a more productive and sustainable future.": "ProFarm କୃଷି ଜ୍ଞାନ ଓ ଡିଜିଟାଲ୍ ଉପକରଣ ଏକ ସ୍ଥାନରେ ଦେଇ ଉତ୍ପାଦକ ଓ ସ୍ଥାୟୀ ଭବିଷ୍ୟତ ପାଇଁ ସହାୟତା କରେ।",
  "Explore agricultural knowledge and discover tools designed to support better farming decisions.": "ଉନ୍ନତ ଚାଷ ନିଷ୍ପତ୍ତି ପାଇଁ ଜ୍ଞାନ ଓ ଉପକରଣ ଜାଣନ୍ତୁ।",
