  "The page you're looking for doesn't exist or may have moved. Don't worry, there's plenty more to explore at ProFarm.": "ଏହି ପୃଷ୍ଠା ନାହିଁ କିମ୍ବା ସ୍ଥାନ ବଦଳିଛି। ProFarmରେ ଅନ୍ୟ ତଥ୍ୟ ଦେଖନ୍ତୁ।",
  "Built for informed, sustainable farming.": "ତଥ୍ୟପୂର୍ଣ୍ଣ ସ୍ଥାୟୀ ଚାଷ ପାଇଁ।",
  "Thoughtfully built for a more sustainable agricultural future.": "ଅଧିକ ସ୍ଥାୟୀ କୃଷି ଭବିଷ୍ୟତ ପାଇଁ ତିଆରି।",
